      "channel": "NARRATION",
      "speaker_id": "narrator",
      "text": "The story’s measure of time is immense, but its problem is easy to understand: strength met strength, and still the danger remained. Whenever one attacker was forced back, the other pressed in. Whenever both were driven away, they returned to the struggle.\n\nThen Yoganidra’s power brought the reversal Brahma had requested.\n\nMadhu and Kaitabha became deluded. Intoxicated with their own strength, they no longer saw the contest clearly. They had fought Vishnu for five thousand years, and pride made them speak as if the advantage were theirs to give.",
